    "text": "<p>The correct representation in six membered pyranose form for the following sugar [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>] is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0055_de0968b252ac.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 469px;\" />&nbsp;</p>"
